@host = http://localhost:5000

### Health (API + database)
GET {{host}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Correlation id round-trip
GET {{host}}/health
X-Correlation-Id: demo-123

### OpenAPI document
GET {{host}}/openapi/v1.json

### ---------------- Teams ----------------

### List teams (paged, sorted)
GET {{host}}/api/teams?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10&sortBy=name&sortDirection=asc

### List teams: search + active filter
GET {{host}}/api/teams?search=fin&isActive=true

### List teams: invalid sort key -> 400 validation problem
GET {{host}}/api/teams?sortBy=password

### Create team -> 201 + Location
# @name createTeam
POST {{host}}/api/teams
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Finanzas FC",
  "code": "fin",
  "coach": "Ana Pérez"
}

### Create duplicate -> 409
POST {{host}}/api/teams
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Finanzas FC",
  "code": "FIN"
}

### Create invalid -> 400 with field errors
POST {{host}}/api/teams
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "code": "F-1"
}

### Get team by id
GET {{host}}/api/teams/{{createTeam.response.body.id}}

### Replace team (PUT)
PUT {{host}}/api/teams/{{createTeam.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Finanzas FC",
  "code": "FIN",
  "coach": "Luis Mejía",
  "isActive": true
}

### Partial update (PATCH): clear the coach only
PATCH {{host}}/api/teams/{{createTeam.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "coach": ""
}

### Delete team -> 204 (repeat: still 204)
DELETE {{host}}/api/teams/{{createTeam.response.body.id}}

### Get deleted team -> 404
GET {{host}}/api/teams/{{createTeam.response.body.id}}

###
